# This folder is a desk, and the repository is the game on it. Everything the
# game does not need to build, run or be worked on stays out.

# --- do not publish: these carry local session ids and transcript paths ------
# Something writes hook payloads and grep output into the working directory
# under bare numeric names, and new ones keep appearing. Matched by shape
# rather than listed by name, because a list goes stale between commits and
# these hold session ids and paths into local transcripts.
# Safe to delete outright; ignored here so a stray one cannot be committed.
/[0-9]*

# --- other projects sharing the folder --------------------------------------
ruflo/
godot-mcp/
block-defense-godot/
greenhold-phaser/
.claude-flow/
anti-slop/
review/
-p/
*.rar

# --- the single file's own history, which git keeps from here on ------------
index.pre-*.backup.html
index.original.backup.html

# --- build output and machine-local state -----------------------------------
# deploy/ is a copy of the game made for Vercel, not a source of truth.
deploy/
.vercel/
node_modules/
.claude/settings.local.json

# A 16MB third-party skill. CLAUDE.md does not reference it and it is not
# this game's to redistribute.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.claude/skills/.claude-flow/
